{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>OVERVIEW</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frightening and immersive Psychological Horror Game featuring a unique story and riveting gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One core game ending. 1 secret game ending.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103940/extras/bb6aebba4744a3792445aa727f4db9a0.poster.avif?t=1774757446\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103940/extras/bb6aebba4744a3792445aa727f4db9a0.webm?t=1774757446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103940/extras/bb6aebba4744a3792445aa727f4db9a0.mp4?t=1774757446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>GAMEPLAY</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wear ancient masks imbued with strange powers and visions to progress through each level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103940/extras/e97639abc5d30c031ad4f2c56eb0d0aa.poster.avif?t=1774757446\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103940/extras/e97639abc5d30c031ad4f2c56eb0d0aa.webm?t=1774757446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103940/extras/e97639abc5d30c031ad4f2c56eb0d0aa.mp4?t=1774757446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>STORY</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something evil is inhabiting your aging grandfather. It